Molgian Bureau runs scheduled chaos events.

== Event Schedule ==
* Micro events: roughly every 20 to 40 minutes
* Major events: roughly every 1 to 2 hours
* Major daily cap: 3

== Announcements ==
* Event channel: '''Special Place'''
* Event pings target the '''Citizens''' role

== Micro Events ==
* Pickpocket
* Claim Rush
* Stimulus Drop

Treasury-aware behavior:
* If Treasury is low/empty, refill-safe events are prioritized so event flow does not stall.

== Major Events ==
* Tax Audit
* Inflation Spike
* Egg Rate Boost
* Fishing Madness
* Coinflip Chaos

== Event Impact ==
Events can affect:
* wallet balances
* work payout multipliers
* fishing outcomes
* hatch quality
* server-wide pacing and competition

